{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>sand:box</strong> is a relaxing &quot;falling sand&quot; style pixel sandbox originally inspired by the retro charm of sand games, but now far more advanced, including digital circuits and playable characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your imagination to craft intricate designs and contraptions, harnessing the dynamic interactions between various components, become a master of automation and electronics, exploiting their power to create awe-inspiring creations.... or just blow everything up!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2179380?t=1751447970","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2179380?t=1751447970","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179380/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751447970","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179380/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751447970","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Community</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179380/extras/f53bc2ec8bd1070f50f87b9ebe33412c.avif?t=1751447970\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br>One of the most enjoyable parts of playing <strong>sand:box</strong> is sharing your d